  "biography": {
    "plain_text": "Travis Burt co-founded Transportation Impact in Emerald Isle, North Carolina, helping businesses reduce parcel and freight costs. He drew on a long UPS career that began unloading packages and progressed into account management. The founders later sold the company. His subsequent interests include an equity partnership in healthcare provider Extivita.",
    "html": "<p>Travis Burt co-founded Transportation Impact in Emerald Isle, North Carolina, helping businesses reduce parcel and freight costs. He drew on a long UPS career that began unloading packages and progressed into account management. The founders later sold the company. His subsequent interests include an equity partnership in healthcare provider Extivita.</p>\r\n",
    "word_count": 50,
    "confidence": {
